## 6. Arbitrage Sandwich

```solidity
// User submits swap with low slippage protection
// Attacker front-runs and back-runs

// Block execution:
// 1. Attacker: Buy token (raises price)
// 2. Victim: Swap at higher price (slippage eaten)
// 3. Attacker: Sell token (profits from victim's worse price)

// PROTECTION: Proper slippage settings
function swap(
    uint256 amountIn,
    uint256 minAmountOut,  // Must be set properly!
    uint256 deadline
) external {
    require(block.timestamp <= deadline, "Expired");
    uint256 amountOut = router.swap(amountIn);
    require(amountOut >= minAmountOut, "Slippage");
}
```

