## Flash Loan Protection Patterns

### 1. Same-Block Price Check

```solidity
mapping(uint256 => uint256) public blockPrices;

function getPrice() public returns (uint256) {
    if (blockPrices[block.number] == 0) {
        blockPrices[block.number] = oracle.getPrice();
    }
    return blockPrices[block.number];
}
```

### 2. Cooldown/Timelock

```solidity
mapping(address => uint256) public lastAction;
uint256 public constant COOLDOWN = 1;  // 1 block minimum

modifier withCooldown() {
    require(block.number > lastAction[msg.sender] + COOLDOWN);
    lastAction[msg.sender] = block.number;
    _;
}
```

### 3. Snapshot Balances

```solidity
// Use past block snapshot for calculations
uint256 pastBalance = token.balanceOfAt(user, block.number - 1);
```

### 4. Flash Loan Detection

```solidity
// Detect if called during flash loan callback
modifier noFlashLoan() {
    require(msg.sender == tx.origin);  // WARNING: breaks composability
    _;
}

// Better: check if balance changed in same block
modifier flashLoanGuard() {
    require(lastDepositBlock[msg.sender] < block.number);
    _;
}
```

