## Audit Checklist

- [ ] Does the protocol use spot prices that can be manipulated with flash loans?
- [ ] Is governance voting weight based on current or past balances?
- [ ] Are deposits/withdrawals time-locked to prevent same-block abuse?
- [ ] Do liquidations use manipulation-resistant pricing?
- [ ] Is the first depositor attack mitigated?
- [ ] Are fee-on-transfer tokens handled in flash loan flows?
- [ ] Are rewards/yields calculated with time-weighted mechanisms?
- [ ] Is there proper slippage protection on swaps?
- [ ] Are cross-protocol price discrepancies possible?
- [ ] Can flash loans be used to manipulate share/token ratios?
